---
import PolicyLayout from '../../../tutoring/layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
---
<PolicyLayout title="Safeguarding statement" lede="How online sessions are kept safe for children and young people.">
  <h2>Outline to complete</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Named safeguarding lead and contact route</li>
    <li>Parent or carer presence and agreement for under-18s</li>
    <li>Session rules: platform, no private messaging, no recording without consent</li>
    <li>DBS check status (state only what is true and current)</li>
    <li>What happens if a concern is raised, and how to make a complaint</li>
  </ul>
</PolicyLayout>
